From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: StellarSeal <emnoigi1452@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 00:17:20 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 088/138] Optimize World getCubes block collision loop

- Cache chunk references across coordinate sweeps to reduce getChunkIfLoaded lookups

- Bypass empty blocks using FastVoxelCache to eliminate virtual method calls

- Fast-path standard full-cube AABB intersections without NMS block dispatch

- Add optimize-voxel-collisions TOML configuration setting in optimizations.physics

- Add unit test coverage for voxel collision and caching

